    "show_share": true,
    "description": "\"Great things are done when men and mountains meet,\" said William Blake, the 19th century English poet. But he had not met the brother and sister mountaineering team, Mirza and Samina Ali Baig for whom great things have been achieved when men, women and mountains meet.",
